\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, high in glory,
\par Lend a listening ear;
\par When we bow before Thee,
\par Children's praises hear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Though Thou art so holy,
\par Heaven's almighty King,
\par Thou wilt stoop to listen
\par When Thy praise we sing.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We are little children,
\par Weak and apt to stray;
\par Saviour, guide and keep us
\par In the heavenly way.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Save us, Lord, from sinning;
\par Watch us day by day;
\par Help us now to love Thee;
\par Take our sins away.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Then, when Thou shalt call us
\par To our heavenly home,
\par We will gladly answer:
\par Saviour, Lord, we come!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

